Notebook[{
Cell["OrthogonalCoordinates", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"9ac1b884-d671-4416-a051-b16620cca439"],

Cell["[LLM Generated]", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"161cb118-0054-42bd-9cb9-446abfd642ac"],

Cell["\<\
OrthogonalCoordinates[graph, c, {a1, a2, ...}, v] returns the Z-valued \
displacement of v on each axis ai through the centre c; \
OrthogonalCoordinates[graph, c, {a1, a2, ...}] returns the Association for \
all vertices. Centre c is a vertex or InfraPoint; each axis ai is an \
InfraSegment, InfraLine, or vertex sequence. Option \"SelectCoordinate\" \
(projection-tie reducer applied to the shifted tied list ix_v - k: \"Centered\
\" (default; 0 if 0 in shifted, else Round[Median]), Min, Max, Mean, Median, \
All, or any user function).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"979370ab-624a-4079-99ef-580b14683dde"],

Cell["Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"106a5f2c-ecd1-45c8-8419-bbd5da218c8a"],

